    {
      "id": "e031c342",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 允许的变量名\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3a344266",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "变量名必须以字母（`A` –`Z`或`a` –`z`）、下划线（`_`）或代码点大于00A0的Unicode字符集中的字符开头。后续字符还可以包括`!`、数字和其他字符。因此，变量名可以包含西里尔字母、希腊字母、各种数学符号等。  \n\n变量名中不得使用空格。\n\n示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f5f670cd",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "Radius = 100"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b44fed69",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "φ = 1.75"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "407cbcdf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "变量名中禁止使用内置**关键字**。\n\n以下是**Julia**中保留关键字的列表：`baremodule`、`begin`、`break`、`catch`、`const`、`continue`、`do`、`else`、`elseif`、`end`、`export`、`false`、`finally`、`for`、`function`、`global`、`if`、`import`、`let`、`local`、`macro`、`module`、`quote`、`return`、`struct`、`true`、`try`、`using`、`while`。这些字符不得用作变量名。\n\n以下由两个单词组成的序列也是保留的：`abstract type`、`mutable struct`、`primitive type`。不过，您可以创建名为`abstract`、`mutable`、`primitive`和`type`的变量。\n\n您可以在 [文档](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/cn/julia/manual/variables.html) 中阅读更多关于变量名称的信息。\n\n在 **AnyMath** 命令行中，可以按以下方式输入特殊的 Unicode 字符：首先输入反斜杠`\\`，然后输入LaTeX符号名称，最后按下Tab键 (TAB)。\n\n例如，变量名$\\alpha$可以在 **AnyMath** 命令行中输入 `\\alpha` + `TAB`：\n\n```\nα = 0.001\n\n```\n\n输入平方根符号的方法是输入`\\sqrt` +`TAB`。\n\n如果你在某处（例如在别人的代码中）遇到一个不认识的字符，且不知道如何输入，请查阅帮助：在 **AnyMath** 命令行中，输入 `?`，然后输入该字符。例如：\n\n```\nhelp?> α\n\"α\" can be typed by \\alpha<tab>\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
