    {
      "id": "9b84fe17",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 数据类型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f2af6f6d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "每个值都必须具有类型，但这并非与变量名相关联（如预编译语言（例如**C/C++**）中常见的情况），而是与值本身相关联。因此，变量无需显式类型声明：一旦为其赋值，其类型便会确定。\n**Julia** 中的数据类型构成了一种结构良好的树状层次结构。顶级（泛型）类型是`Any`。所有其他类型都是其子类型。类型`Number`是`Any`的子类型。反过来，`Number`是`Real`和`Complex`的超类型。图中展示了 **Julia** 中 `Number` 子类型的层次结构。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "afa43572",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "![image.png](attachment:image.png)\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "image.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "51ea4cce",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 整数类型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1a5581d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**整数类型** `Integer`是`Real`类型的子类型。而`Integer`的子类型包括`Int8`、\n`Int16`、`Int32`、`Int64`、`Int128` （有符号）以及`UInt8`、`UInt16`、`UInt32`、`UInt64`、`UInt128` （无符号）。此处，$8$、$16$、$32$、$64$和$128$分别表示变量在内存中占用的位数。 \n\n变量可取的最低值和最大值可分别通过`typemin()`和`typemax()`函数获取。\n\n以下示例演示了**Julia**整数类型的取值范围参数：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aea965ca",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for T in [Int8,Int16,Int32,Int64,Int128,UInt8,UInt16,UInt32,UInt64,UInt128]\r\n     println(\"$(lpad(T,7)): [$(typemin(T)),$(typemax(T))]\")\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3623f8b6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "执行此代码将产生以下输出： \n\n```julia\n  Int8: [-128,127]\n  Int16: [-32768,32767]\n  Int32: [-2147483648,2147483647]\n  Int64: [-9223372036854775808,9223372036854775807]\n Int128: [-170141183460469231731687303715884105728,170141183460469231731687303715884105727]\n  UInt8: [0,255]\n UInt16: [0,65535]\n UInt32: [0,4294967295]\n UInt64: [0,18446744073709551615]\nUInt128: [0,340282366920938463463374607431768211455]\n```\n\n声明整数变量的示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
