          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8c370a1e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 实数类型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "436ce772",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**实数类型** `AbstractFloat`包含以下类型：`Float16`、`Float32`和`Float64`。类型名称中的数字表示存储该变量在内存中占用的字节数。例如：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
