    {
      "id": "bd6a1ce4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 复数类型\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d4451896",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "全局常量`im`表示虚数单位$i$ （即$–1$的平方根的主值）。**复数**表示为`a + b im`，其中`a`和`b`是实数。例如：`3+2im`，`-1-5im`，等等。请注意，虚部与恒定`im`之间的乘号`* `可以省略。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
