    {
      "id": "afe2bdd0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n如果对实数进行运算的结果是复数，则必须先使用`complex`函数将该实数转换为复数类型。\n\n例如，对负数开平方根的操作如下：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9f6ad0c1",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "sqrt(complex(-2))"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f99daf9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "以下是一个计算负数自然对数的示例：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ef2203d6",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "log(complex(-1))"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
