    },
    {
      "id": "c4688c6f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "我们将在第05节“字符与字符串”中更详细地讨论字符和字符串类型。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
