    {
      "id": "0995347b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "如果浮点数的尾数部分不为0，则在尝试将其转换为整数类型时会发生错误。例如：\n\n```\nInt(3.14)\n\nERROR: InexactError: Int64(3.14)\nStacktrace:\n [1] Int64(x::Float64)\n   @ Base ./float.jl:900\n [2] top-level scope\n   @ In[29]:1\n```\n\n将布尔型转换为整数型： \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
