    {
      "id": "b40d5089",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n要将字符串类型的变量 `x` 转换为数值类型 `T`（整数或实数），请使用 `parse` 函数：\n\n```\nparse(T, x)\n```\n\n示例。将字符串转换为整数类型：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "46625494",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "parse(Int, \"123\")"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
