    {
      "id": "8309cf06",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 特殊浮点数值\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "de3eecc2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "有三个已定义的标准浮点数值，它们不对应实数轴上的任何一点：\n* `Inf`是正无穷大。该值大于所有有限浮点数值。\n* `-Inf`是负无穷大。该值小于所有有限浮点数值。\n* `NaN`表示“非数值”。该值不等于任何浮点数值（包括其自身）。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d3eb3ea5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "这些值是某些算术运算的结果：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
